    <div class="panel p-9" data-reveal="right">
      <h2 class="font-display text-3xl font-semibold text-ivory">Send us a Message</h2>
      <p class="mt-2 text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-gold">Replies directly on WhatsApp</p>
      <form id="contactForm" class="mt-7 space-y-4">
        <div><label class="mb-1.5 block text-sm" for="cfName">Name *</label><input id="cfName" required class="field" placeholder="Your full name"></div>
        <div><label class="mb-1.5 block text-sm" for="cfEmail">Email *</label><input id="cfEmail" required type="email" class="field" placeholder="you@example.com"></div>
        <div><label class="mb-1.5 block text-sm" for="cfPhone">Phone</label><input id="cfPhone" type="tel" class="field" placeholder="+91"></div>
        <div><label class="mb-1.5 block text-sm" for="cfSubject">Subject *</label><input id="cfSubject" required class="field" placeholder="Bridal set enquiry…"></div>
        <div><label class="mb-1.5 block text-sm" for="cfMsg">Message *</label><textarea id="cfMsg" required rows="4" class="field resize-none" placeholder="Your message…"></textarea></div>
        <button class="btn-gold w-full py-4">Send via WhatsApp</button>
      </form>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ─────────── FAQS ─────────── -->
<section data-page="faqs" class="page hidden mx-auto max-w-[1100px] px-5 py-20 lg:px-8">
  <p class="eyebrow justify-center" data-reveal="up">Need help?</p>
  <h1 class="draw-c mt-5 text-center font-display text-5xl font-semibold text-ivory sm:text-6xl" data-reveal="up">Frequently <em class="accent-it">Asked</em></h1>
  <div class="mt-12 space-y-4">
    <div class="faq-item open panel overflow-hidden" data-reveal="up"><button class="faq-q flex w-full items-center justify-between gap-6 px-7 py-5 text-left font-display text-xl text-ivory">What is your return policy?<span class="relative flex h-9 w-9 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-gold/40 text-gold"><span class="absolute h-px w-4 bg-current"></span><span class="faq-v absolute h-px w-4 rotate-90 bg-current transition-transform duration-300"></span></span></button><div class="acc-body"><div class="overflow-hidden"><p class="px-7 pb-6 text-[15px] leading-relaxed">We offer a 30-day return policy for all jewelry. Items must be in original, unworn condition with all packaging, tags, and documentation intact.</p></div></div></div>
    <div class="faq-item panel overflow-hidden" data-reveal="up"><button class="faq-q flex w-full items-center justify-between gap-6 px-7 py-5 text-left font-display text-xl text-ivory">How long does shipping take?<span class="relative flex h-9 w-9 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-gold/40 text-gold"><span class="absolute h-px w-4 bg-current"></span><span class="faq-v absolute h-px w-4 rotate-90 bg-current transition-transform duration-300"></span></span></button><div class="acc-body"><div class="overflow-hidden"><p class="px-7 pb-6 text-[15px] leading-relaxed">Domestic orders are dispatched within 24 hours and delivered in 3–5 business days. Every shipment is fully insured.</p></div></div></div>
    <div class="faq-item panel overflow-hidden" data-reveal="up"><button class="faq-q flex w-full items-center justify-between gap-6 px-7 py-5 text-left font-display text-xl text-ivory">Do you offer international shipping?<span class="relative flex h-9 w-9 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-gold/40 text-gold"><span class="absolute h-px w-4 bg-current"></span><span class="faq-v absolute h-px w-4 rotate-90 bg-current transition-transform duration-300"></span></span></button><div class="acc-body"><div class="overflow-hidden"><p class="px-7 pb-6 text-[15px] leading-relaxed">Yes. We ship worldwide via fully insured express couriers (7–10 business days).</p></div></div></div>
    <div class="faq-item panel overflow-hidden" data-reveal="up"><button class="faq-q flex w-full items-center justify-between gap-6 px-7 py-5 text-left font-display text-xl text-ivory">How do I care for my jewelry?<span class="relative flex h-9 w-9 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-gold/40 text-gold"><span class="absolute h-px w-4 bg-current"></span><span class="faq-v absolute h-px w-4 rotate-90 bg-current transition-transform duration-300"></span></span></button><div class="acc-body"><div class="overflow-hidden"><p class="px-7 pb-6 text-[15px] leading-relaxed">Store in pouches, avoid perfumes/chemicals, clean with the provided cloth. Professional servicing recommended yearly.</p></div></div></div>
    <div class="faq-item panel overflow-hidden" data-reveal="up"><button class="faq-q flex w-full items-center justify-between gap-6 px-7 py-5 text-left font-display text-xl text-ivory">Are your products authentic?<span class="relative flex h-9 w-9 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-gold/40 text-gold"><span class="absolute h-px w-4 bg-current"></span><span class="faq-v absolute h-px w-4 rotate-90 bg-current transition-transform duration-300"></span></span></button><div class="acc-body"><div class="overflow-hidden"><p class="px-7 pb-6 text-[15px] leading-relaxed">Absolutely. Every piece is BIS hallmarked / certified with a serial-numbered warranty card.</p></div></div></div>
    <div class="faq-item panel overflow-hidden" data-reveal="up"><button class="faq-q flex w-full items-center justify-between gap-6 px-7 py-5 text-left font-display text-xl text-ivory">Can I get a custom or personalised design?<span class="relative flex h-9 w-9 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-gold/40 text-gold"><span class="absolute h-px w-4 bg-current"></span><span class="faq-v absolute h-px w-4 rotate-90 bg-current transition-transform duration-300"></span></span></button><div class="acc-body"><div class="overflow-hidden"><p class="px-7 pb-6 text-[15px] leading-relaxed">Yes — bespoke engraving, custom stone settings and made-to-order bridal sets via WhatsApp commission.</p></div></div></div>
    <div class="faq-item panel overflow-hidden" data-reveal="up"><button class="faq-q flex w-full items-center justify-between gap-6 px-7 py-5 text-left font-display text-xl text-ivory">What payment methods do you accept?<span class="relative flex h-9 w-9 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-gold/40 text-gold"><span class="absolute h-px w-4 bg-current"></span><span class="faq-v absolute h-px w-4 rotate-90 bg-current transition-transform duration-300"></span></span></button><div class="acc-body"><div class="overflow-hidden"><p class="px-7 pb-6 text-[15px] leading-relaxed">UPI, credit/debit cards, net banking and wallets with 256-bit encryption. Orders confirmed on WhatsApp.</p></div></div></div>
    <div class="faq-item panel overflow-hidden" data-reveal="up"><button class="faq-q flex w-full items-center justify-between gap-6 px-7 py-5 text-left font-display text-xl text-ivory">How can I track my order?<span class="relative flex h-9 w-9 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-gold/40 text-gold"><span class="absolute h-px w-4 bg-current"></span><span class="faq-v absolute h-px w-4 rotate-90 bg-current transition-transform duration-300"></span></span></button><div class="acc-body"><div class="overflow-hidden"><p class="px-7 pb-6 text-[15px] leading-relaxed">You'll receive a live tracking link via email and WhatsApp once dispatched.</p></div></div></div>
  </div>
  <div class="panel mt-14 p-10 text-center" data-reveal="zoom">
    <h2 class="font-display text-3xl font-semibold text-ivory sm:text-4xl">Still have questions?</h2>
    <p class="mx-auto mt-3 max-w-2xl text-[15px]">Our jewelry specialists are available 24/7 — we're passionate about helping you find the perfect piece.</p>
    <a href="#/contact" class="btn-gold mt-8 px-9 py-3.5">Contact Us</a>
  </div>
</section>
</main>

